      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GONZALO.\nI’ll warrant him for drowning, though the ship were no stronger than a nutshell, and as leaky as an unstanched wench.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
