      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nWe are merely cheated of our lives by drunkards.\nThis wide-chapp’d rascal—would thou might’st lie drowning\nThe washing of ten tides!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
