      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GONZALO.\nHe’ll be hang’d yet,\nThough every drop of water swear against it,\nAnd gape at wid’st to glut him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
